/-!
# Evaluation of the recovered Fi23 lift words

The retained 286-node straight-line program is interpreted in the genuine Fi23
carrier. Kernel-checked numerical identities certify each shared product and
each inverse; single-use products are composed directly. The two source-map
comparisons are the only hypotheses. In particular, neither output evaluation,
centralization, membership, nor any extra group relation is assumed.

The endpoints are exactly the unchanged `liftA` and `liftB` tables consumed by
`GeneratorLifts.exists_generator_lifts_of_word_tables`. That consumer supplies
the centralizer and exact Fi22-coordinate conclusions. The independent
source-map producer and the unconditional assembly remain with their owners.

Source: GLS3 Table 5.3u and the Fischer paragraph of
`refs/KGroup/GLS3/Chapter5(sec3-).tex`, line 1042; ATLAS F23G1-p31671B0.
`WordEvaluation/source/generate.py` reproduces these certificates from the
retained program and original tables. The GAP right-action to Lean left-action
conversion inverts each table and preserves the multiplication order.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.Fischer.Fi23.CentralizerSection.GeneratorLiftCertificate
